{"articleNo":"83459","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=83459&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013년 산학협력선도대학(LINC)육성사업 창업동아리 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.05.21","hit":"3777","attachments":[{"name":"창업동아리신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=83459&attachNo=71689"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">창업교육센터에서는 교육과학기술부에서 지원하는 산학협력 선도대학</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(LINC) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">육성사업의 일환으로 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 창업동아리를 모집하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">독창적이고 우수한 창업 아이템 및 시작품을 제작할 수 있는 기반을 최대한 마련하여 학생들의 창업 및 대내외 활동을 적극적으로 지원하고자 합니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">금오공과대학교 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">1. 대 상 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">창업에 관심 있는 우리학교 재학생으로 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">인 이상으로 구성된 팀</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">2. 지원내용 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">시작품제작비용</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">재료비</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">소모성</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">),<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">동아리활동비(지원금의 10%이내)&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">등 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">3. 총지원금액 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 97%\">총</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 97%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">64,000</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 97%\">만원지원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 97%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(16</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 97%\">개팀</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 97%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 97%\">팀당 평균 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 97%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">400</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 97%\">만원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 97%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 97%\">아이템별 차등지원</span><br><font color=\"#f29661\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">**</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">우수 아이템 특별지원</span></strong></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">4. 지원분야 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지식</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기술&nbsp;등&nbsp;전분야 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">5. 시작품 제작기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">선정일</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(6</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월중</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) ~ 2013</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">12</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">31</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">6. 기타 혜택 </span><span>; <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">LINC사업단 해외신기술 견학관련 마일리지 부여</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">팀원모두</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">7. <strong>창업동아리 신청기간 </strong></span><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 5</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">21</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">~ 6</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">05</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><u>**미비한 서류 및 수정&nbsp;서류 제출 기한 : 6월 10일&nbsp;12시까지&nbsp;</u></span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">8. 창업동아리 신청방법 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">직접 방문</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이오스관 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">313</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">호 창업교육센터</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 또는 이메일</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><a href=\"mailto:freespirits@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">freespirits@kumoh.ac.kr</span></u></a><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">9. 관련 문의전화 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">창업교육센터 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">054-478-6947, 6948</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
